<title>JAPAN: Japan April crude imports up 6.9 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan April crude imports up 6.9 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's April crude oil imports grew by 6.9 percent from a year earlier to 22.84 million kilolitres, or 4.78 million barrels per day, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, the April figure fell 7.1 per cent from March levels.</p>
</text>
